    "summary": "Nextcloud public shares allow downloading individual subdirectories independently as on-the-fly zip archives. Unlike GenImage Google Drive (which requires downloading a multi-part split volume sequence totaling ~24 GB before any image can be read), TGIF enables targeted downloading of specific directories (e.g. masks at 40.4 MB, or orig at 6.8 GB, or sd2-sp at 17.3 GB).",
